 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and self-consistent: definition bodies stay unexposed with `(rfl)`-proved `_def` lemmas, the three general results are public in their canonical upstream namespaces while only subject-specific steps are `private`, and the characteristic API (values, parity, regularity, recurrence, ladder pair, first and second derivatives at and off the origin, ODE) is complete with confluent `simp`/`grind =`/`fun_prop` annotations. No compatibility artifacts and no declarations duplicating Mathlib (`mul_sinc`, `analyticAt_sinc`, `Function.Even.odd_deriv`, `ContinuousAt.eq_zero_of_forall_id_mul_eq_zero` all absent upstream).",
